+
+## Claude Code Review
+
+Claude Code Review posts inline findings tagged 🔴 Important, 🟡 Nit, or 🟣 Pre-existing, plus a `Claude Code Review` check run. The tag is the bot's guess, not a verdict. A 🔴 finding starts as `fix` or `ask`. A 🟡 finding is a `dismiss` candidate once the code proves it. A 🟣 finding predates the PR, so park it as a follow-up unless it falls under Ask by default. Re-run the review with a top-level `@claude review` comment after a fix wave, not after every push.
